{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17253","headline":"自杨子归丹阳初遂闲居聊呈惠公 · 权德舆","name":"自杨子归丹阳初遂闲居聊呈惠公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"移疾喜无事，卷帘松竹寒。\n稍知名是累，日与静相欢。\n蹇浅逢机少，迂疎应物难。\n只思闲夜月，共向沃州看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}